# Worker patch artifact

The exact repository patch is the uncommitted diff in the assigned worktree:

    git diff -- tests/packs/rendering/presenter_selected_cut_query.mjs tests/packs/rendering/test_presenter_selected_cut_aggregate.py

It is intentionally kept as source changes in the worker worktree so the
harness can commit the same two files without an independently generated
patch becoming a second source of truth.
